<title>TURKMENISTAN: Turkmen Jan-Mar ind output falls 14.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Turkmen Jan-Mar ind output falls 14.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ASHGABAT 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkmenistan's industrial production in January-March fell 14.7 percent compared to a fall of 9.9 percent a year earlier, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> TURKMEN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT   Jan-Mar 97  Jan-Feb 97  Jan-Mar 96</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change     -14.7	 -9.9	  -9.9</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
